		DisplayName: Essencebound Breaker Blade
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Striking enemies binds them to the blade
			Right-click pulls every bound enemy into a devastating cleave
			Distant bindings pull harder and deal more damage
			Bindings snap at extreme range or when obstructed
			'''
